on":1,"section_title":"Introduction","source":{"current_hash_method":"tex-environment-body-comments-removed","current_statement_sha256":"sha256:022b5491ed1405845c36403399913c0a7819c9d92cc0392eb60110ac8e999b48","file":"preprints/Lifting-sections-from-the-reduced-support-of-an-adjoint-September-27-2026/build/sections/introduction.tex","line":54,"producer_hash_method":"atlas-whitespace-normalized-text","producer_statement_sha256":"46ed2b5b6a51d20cee64baefdb196037bc6ed98c97e3201d72f072b554fcc4c5","provenance":{"kind":"computed","pin":"fd4aeeb2ee4fc729c18d98444fed42fd0529eeeb","source":"preprints/Lifting-sections-from-the-reduced-support-of-an-adjoint-September-27-2026/build/sections/introduction.tex"},"sha256":"sha256:022b5491ed1405845c36403399913c0a7819c9d92cc0392eb60110ac8e999b48","url":"https://github.com/openai/math/blob/fd4aeeb2ee4fc729c18d98444fed42fd0529eeeb/preprints/Lifting-sections-from-the-reduced-support-of-an-adjoint-September-27-2026/build/sections/introduction.tex#L54"},"statement_kind":"theorem","text":"\\label{bl:thm:conditional}\nAssume that every smooth connected projective complex variety $W$ with\npseudo-effective $K_W$, in every dimension, has a nonzero section of\n$mK_W$ for some $m>0$. Let $(X,\\Delta)$ be a normal projective\nlog canonical pair over an algebraically closed field of characteristic\nzero, with $\\Delta$ an effective rational boundary and\n$D=K_X+\\Delta$ a nef $\\Q$-Cartier divisor. Then $D$ is semiample."}
